      "en": "All the people of Judah took Azariah, who was sixteen years old, and made him king in the place of his father Amaziah.",
      "ko": "유다 온 백성이 아사랴로 그 부친 아마샤를 대신하여 왕을 삼으니 때에 나이 십 륙세라",
      "source_text_hash": "ed9f35d549bc3aaa2c42b328ccc196bf16609b1a744ecefc8f705c7396cf12f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1ff028fc8b5f0fc47e26740bd5809701b94ee02fa107b83c22449868c5bb598",
