      "en": "He did that which was evil in the LORD’s sight. He didn’t depart from all the sins of Jeroboam the son of Nebat, with which he made Israel to sin.",
      "ko": "여호와 보시기에 악을 행하여 이스라엘로 범죄케한 느밧의 아들 여로보암의 모든 죄에서 떠나지 아니하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "d1ae68e6c4b5110190be860f8b183f31b7bad81e10f8400c42f51c9dad05d221",
      "translation_text_hash": "7ca87aa32cba95c505fb1cc415d6654c68fe4fd2f2329f78a2052bdb893661b6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
